[en.FOCUS_C12_AMMUNITION_BOTANY]
Ammunition Botany

[en.FOCUS_C12_AMMUNITION_BOTANY_desc]
Thanks to the involvement of many specialized botanist ponies, the promotion of this discipline at the rock farm seemed downright fantastical to many ponies. However, in reality, this science was supported by rigorous theories and had been studied by a few scientists for decades. It involved techniques on how to turn fruits of plants into specialty ammunition to reduce costs or how to blend them in optimal proportions into gunpowder to significantly enhance combustion efficiency.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_AMMUNITION_BOTANY]
弹药植物学

[zh.FOCUS_C12_AMMUNITION_BOTANY_desc]
得益于许多植物专精小马的参与，采石农场推广的这门学科在许多小马眼中简直异想天开，但事实上，这门科学有严谨的理论支撑并被少数科学家研究了数十年，涉及如何将植物的果实制成特式弹药来降低成本或者以最佳的比例混入火药中以显著提高燃烧效率。

